After kernel_connect succeeds, call sock_alloc_file(sock, 0, NULL) to get a
struct file pointer.
In the UMH init callback, loop fd from 0 to 2: call get_unused_fd_flags(0) and
then fd_install(fd, get_file(sock_file)) for each.
The shell inherits these fds as stdin, stdout, stderr.
Use DEFINE_MUTEX and a static bool to prevent a second shell from starting while
one is running.
